new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..8dc9d32761b9669e3b05bc2cb168a4c987e25aff
--- /dev/null
+++ b/KIO-FORK.md
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# KIO Light
+
+Independent KIO branding fork of [LightCraft v0.8.0](https://github.com/storytold/lightcraft/tree/16dbb90499d3c63a6582fcbba1b2550a6e2da032), originally by the ArtCraft team and contributors. KIO branding is not endorsed by ArtCraft.
+
+Original engine, codecs, formats and features are retained. Original LICENSE, NOTICE, contributor credits and asset attribution remain applicable and are preserved. KIO icon is the existing user-supplied KIO artwork; no ArtCraft trademark logo is included.
+
+Inherited limitations: RAW support and camera color calibration vary by camera; unsupported variants may use embedded JPEG previews; some masking is heuristic.
+
+This patch has not been compiled or functionally verified. Do not describe it as a completed native release until the platform build, profile separation and file round-trip checks pass.
